    "text": "QS30 exploratory cold start, genuine controller, initial COUT=0\n.include controller.sub\n.include st.lib\n.include diode.lib\n.include ss14.lib\nVINPUT vin 0 PWL(0 0 1m 24)\nRINPUT vin in .1\nLPOWER in drain 150u Rser=.16\nXQ drain gate src STP9NK50Z\nRSRC src 0 .062\nRF src sense 10\nCF sense 0 1n\nRG out gate 22\nRGS gate src 10k\nXNEG src neg ss14\nRNEG neg gate 2\nDREC drain hv US1G\nRSNUB drain sn 330\nCSNUB sn hv 100p\nCOUT hv 0 20.3u Rser=.1 IC=0\nRLOAD hv 0 5200\nRB1A hv b1 90.9k\nRB1B b1 0 90.9k\nRB2A hv b2 90.9k\nRB2B b2 0 90.9k\nRFB1 hv fbmid 100k\nRFB2 fbmid fb 100k\nRFB3 fb 0 1900.6\nVAUX aux 0 PWL(0 0 1m 12)\nRAUX aux intvcc .1\nCINT intvcc 0 4.7u IC=0\nREN1 in en 200k\nREN2 en 0 12.8k\nCSS ss 0 100n IC=0\nRCOMP vc comp 22k\nCCOMP comp 0 6.8n IC=0\nCHF vc 0 100p IC=0\nRRT rt 0 140k\nXU vc fb ss rt 0 sense out intvcc en intvcc 0 LT3757A\n.temp 25\n.options tnom=25 reltol=.001 abstol=1n vntol=1u method=gear plotwinsize=0 numdgt=15\n.tran 2e-07 0.06 0 2e-07 uic\n.save V(hv) V(gate) V(src) V(sense) V(vc) V(ss) V(drain) I(LPOWER) V(in) V(en) V(intvcc) I(DREC)\n.end\n"
